          "Consolidate and expand the college-educated coalition through education and expertise-based governance messaging: the 39.1% college attainment is the foundation of the Democratic hold, and this constituency responds to candidates who demonstrably understand complex policy and deliver measurable results on schools, healthcare access, and infrastructure — not to abstract ideology.",
