          "Develop workforce and higher education policy tied to rural retention: at 23.9% college attainment and $60,038 income, families in HD-75 are making real decisions about whether their children stay in rural Kansas; legislative advocacy for community college affordability, technical education access, and rural job creation directly addresses whether the district retains or loses its young adults."
