          "Understand the 27% opposition: whether concentrated among younger renters, rural workers with healthcare concerns, or specific geographic pockets matters for both holding and growing this seat; treating 73% as a stable floor rather than a margin requiring active maintenance invites a credible challenger to test assumptions.",
