          "Lead on housing and renter economic security: with 58.2% renter rate and $49,372 median income, housing affordability and tenant protection are the material concerns driving household economics; eviction law, rental standard enforcement, and affordable housing development are the tangible issues this constituency evaluates on.",
          "Engage Hispanic constituents on economic mobility with specificity: 50% of the district is Hispanic, making this a majority-Hispanic district in practical terms; bilingual constituent service, workforce development targeting Hispanic workers, and attention to immigrant family economic integration are non-negotiable for a representative seeking to hold this seat.",
          "Do not assume the 100% Democratic margin indicates voter enthusiasm; instead, clarify whether it reflects active support for Martinez's record, fragmented Republican recruitment, or low-propensity voting in a low-information cycle — and address whichever constraint actually exists."
