          "Lead with working-class economic concerns — housing affordability (41.7% renters at $64K income), wage sustainability, healthcare access, and the gap between rents and household incomes are the material daily concerns of this young (29.2 median age), rental-dependent constituency and the most reliable mobilizing issues.",
