          "Engage the affluent homeowner majority on property tax fairness and municipal service delivery: in a district at $97,116 median income with 69% homeownership, fiscal responsibility and concrete improvements in schools, roads, and parks are the material concerns that hold Democratic support across affluent suburbs.",
