          "Provide explicit constituent attention to the 7.17% Hispanic/Latino community: in a predominantly white affluent district, Hispanic residents deserve specific engagement on economic opportunity, healthcare access, and education equity rather than being treated as a secondary demographic or absorbed into a broader inclusion narrative."
