          "Treat the 40% Democratic result as a floor for expansion, not a ceiling: a shift of 4-5 percentage points in college-educated voter preference — entirely achievable through targeted messaging on healthcare, climate, and democratic stability — would make this a competitive or Democratic-leaning race despite the current 60-40 partisan result."
